@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<div class="privacy-page">
    <div class="privacy-card">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="privacy-header">
            <h1>
                <i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i>
                Privacy Policy
            </h1>

            <p>
                Your privacy is important to us.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="privacy-content">

            <p>
                Welcome to <strong>AnkitKart</strong>. This Privacy Policy explains
                how we collect, use, protect, and handle your information when you
                use our website and services.
            </p>

            <hr class="privacy-divider">

            <h4>1. Information We Collect</h4>

            <p>
                When you create an account, place an order, or use our website,
                we may collect information such as:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>Name</li>
                <li>Email address</li>
                <li>Phone number</li>
                <li>Shipping and billing information</li>
                <li>Account login information</li>
                <li>Order and purchase details</li>
            </ul>

            <h4>2. How We Use Your Information</h4>

            <p>
                We may use the information we collect to:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>Create and manage your account</li>
                <li>Process and deliver your orders</li>
                <li>Communicate with you about your orders</li>
                <li>Provide customer support</li>
                <li>Improve our website and services</li>
                <li>Maintain website security</li>
            </ul>

            <h4>3. Account Information</h4>

            <p>
                If you create an account on AnkitKart, you are responsible for
                keeping your login credentials confidential. Please contact us
                if you believe that your account has been accessed without
                authorization.
            </p>

            <h4>4. Payment Information</h4>

            <p>
                Payment information may be processed through third-party payment
                providers. We do not intentionally store sensitive payment
                information such as complete card numbers on our servers.
            </p>

            <h4>5. Cookies</h4>

            <p>
                Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to maintain
                user sessions, remember preferences, improve functionality,
                and understand how visitors use our website.
            </p>

            <h4>6. Data Security</h4>

            <p>
                We take reasonable measures to protect your personal information
                against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or
                destruction. However, no method of transmission or storage
                over the internet can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
            </p>

            <h4>7. Third-Party Services</h4>

            <p>
                Our website may use third-party services for purposes such as
                payment processing, email communication, analytics, hosting,
                or other website functionality. These services may have their
                own privacy policies.
            </p>

            <h4>8. Children's Privacy</h4>

            <p>
                Our services are not intentionally designed for children.
                We do not knowingly collect personal information from children
                without appropriate consent.
            </p>

            <h4>9. Your Rights</h4>

            <p>
                Depending on applicable law, you may have rights regarding your
                personal information, including requesting access, correction,
                or deletion of certain information.
            </p>

            <h4>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h4>

            <p>
                We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes
                will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
            </p>

            <h4>11. Contact Us</h4>

            <p>
                If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your
                information is handled, please contact the AnkitKart support
                team.
            </p>

            <div class="privacy-updated">
                <strong>Last Updated:</strong> September 10, 2026
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>
